From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rui Figueira <rfigueira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 22:41:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add set_text_input_value: IDL value override decoupled from
 attribute

DocumentMutator::set_text_input_value pushes the JS-side IDL .value
into the text editor and records it as TextInputData.value_override.
Layout construction re-derives the display text from the value
attribute on every pass; the override takes precedence so a JS value
write isn't clobbered back to the attribute text on the next frame.
While the override is set, attribute writes/removals no longer touch
the editor (they only change defaultValue per HTML's decoupling).
---
 src/layout/construct.rs | 14 ++++++-
 src/mutator.rs          | 84 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 src/node/text.rs        |  8 ++++
 3 files changed, 94 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/layout/construct.rs b/src/layout/construct.rs
